    <div class="section-head"><h2 id="faq-h">Questions owners ask before they hire us</h2></div>
    <div class="faq"><details><summary>What's the difference between Starter, Growth and Growth Partner?</summary><div><p>Starter is just the website: a fast, mobile-friendly site built to turn local searches into calls, starting at $799 one-time. Growth adds ongoing local visibility on top of a custom website: directory and listings setup, local SEO including Google Business Profile optimization, and hosting and maintenance, starting at $1,499 setup plus $349/month. Growth Partner is the complete setup: everything in Growth plus a dedicated business phone line with call tracking, business cards, follow-up automations, email campaigns, a monthly report and a monthly strategy call, starting at $1,499 setup plus $699/month. Every price is a starting point — scope is confirmed in writing after a free discovery call.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you really build my website before I pay?</summary><div><p>Yes. Send your business name and trade, and within one business day we build a working draft of your homepage with your logo, services and service area. You see it on a 15-minute call. If you don't want it, you owe nothing.</p></div></details><details><summary>How is a website live so fast?</summary><div><p>We've already done the slow parts. Each trade has a tested layout, page structure and copy framework. On your approval call we add your details, photos and reviews, connect your domain and switch it on. It goes live the next business day.</p></div></details><details><summary>How do I pay?</summary><div><p>Starter is a one-time fee, paid in full once you approve your preview — no payment before that. Growth and Growth Partner's setup fee is 50% to start, 50% after you approve it and before launch, then the monthly fee begins at launch. Other add-ons for Starter clients are billed monthly and are optional; you can cancel any of them with 30 days' notice.</p></div></details><details><summary>Why does pricing say "starting at"?</summary><div><p>Every business is different, so scope is confirmed in writing after a free discovery call — that's what decides your final price.</p></div></details><details><summary>What does the hosting add-on cover?</summary><div><p>For Starter clients, hosting, updates and maintenance is a separate add-on starting at $79/month: fast hosting, SSL, uptime and security monitoring, software updates, backups and up to 30 minutes of edits a month. It's optional, and included in Growth and Growth Partner's monthly fee. If you'd rather host Starter yourself, we hand over the files at launch.</p></div></details>{# TODO(Levi): confirm the 90-day upgrade-and-pay-the-difference policy still applies when upgrading to Growth Partner, not just Growth. #}<details><summary>Can I upgrade from Starter later?</summary><div><p>Yes. We keep your content and photos and build out the extra scope. You only pay the difference if you upgrade to Growth or Growth Partner within 90 days of launch.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do I own the website?</summary><div><p>Yes. Once it's paid for, you own your domain, content and the site files on every package. No lock-in.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can you redesign my existing site without losing my Google rankings?</summary><div><p>Yes. We map every existing URL, keep the pages that rank, and set up 301 redirects for anything that moves, so the authority your current site has built carries over.</p></div></details></div>
